  </tr><tr>
    <td><b>Synthetic failure rate</b><div class="note">the configured synthetic checks that took part in this case</div></td>
    <td><b>100%</b><div class="note">of 3 synthetic check observations in the window</div></td>
    <td>Measured<div class="note">confidence: High</div></td>
    <td>active-probe observers (customer-path checks)<div class="note">coverage: the configured check targets and vantages only — a synthetic failure proves the configured transaction failed from that vantage, nothing more</div><div class="note">3 of 3 synthetic check observations failed (directly measured).</div></td>
  </tr><tr>
    <td><b>Flow-volume change</b></td>
    <td><b>Not measured</b></td>
    <td>Not measured</td>
    <td>Not measured — no evidence source for this measure took part in the case.</td>
  </tr><tr>
